#tr.en: No one can disperse the cosmic powers of that temple 
15'. szu-luh ki#? sikil#-bi ki-gin7# [...] 
#tr.en: Its pure place(!) of washing rites(?), like the earth, does not cease 
16'. me-bi me#? x-x [...] 
